/-- OEIS A389790 Conjecture: a(n) > 0 for all n >= 474.
This is an analog of Goldbach's conjecture. It has been verified for n <= 2*10^5. -/
theorem oeis_a389790_conjecture_1 : ∀ n : ℕ, 474 ≤ n → 0 < a n := by
  intro n h1
